cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite this corpus, cite the individual publication by its identifier and version,
  not this repository. The permanent identifier route resolves to the current canonical
  URL. A version-pinned archive URL is immutable and is the correct target for a citation
  that must not move.
title: NEO AI Research Corpus
abstract: >-
  The public research corpus of the NEO AI Research Program, covering NEO AI, an
  Intelligence Operating System in operational deployment inside My NEO Group and in
  controlled pilot programmes, with general public availability targeted for early
  2027. Research papers,
  institutional publications and technical notes on orchestration, governance of
  autonomous work, evidence architecture and human authority in agentic systems. Every
  material statement carries a claim class distinguishing established fact from
  architectural interpretation, design intent and open problem. No benchmark and no
  comparison against any other system is reported.
type: dataset
